of our business will depend, in part, on our ability to adapt and respond effectively to these changes on a timely basis. If it is unable
to develop new solutions and products that satisfy our clients and provide enhancements and new features for our existing products that
keep pace with rapid technological and industry change, our business, results of operations and financial condition could be adversely
affected. If new technologies emerge that are able to deliver competitive products and services at lower prices more efficiently, more
conveniently or more securely, such technologies could adversely impact our ability to compete effectively. Our current competitors include:</span></p>

