<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Highly
Secured Multi-Tenant System.</i> The Youxin Cloud system uses multi-tenant-oriented cloud services resource-sharing scheme, with good
