is shared by multiple tenants. The solution allows Youxin Cloud-based tenant-built corporate applications to operate on shared infrastructure
servers or dedicated servers through configuration routing. This design enables simple tenant hierarchy, lowers the risk of infrastructure
failures for big tenants, enhances system scalability and security, and enables deployment in a variety of locations.</span></p>

