    real-time online communication between distribution chain participants. Managers gain AI-driven insights into frontline operations
    to proactively identify issues and allocate resources. Sales teams can dynamically identify optimal distribution channels and respond
    to instructions in real-time. The system automatically initiates smart approval workflows for incentive policies with full-process
    synchronization. For example, if a certain distributor needs an incentive policy that the brand did not previously provide, based
    on AI+PaaS solution, they can quickly initiate an application to the corresponding manager. The manager will review and approve it
    at the same time as the information is synchronized. The platform&#8217;s benefits are not limited to just incentive policy communication;
    traditionally, the communication of frontline information about consumer goods has been a time-consuming process with numerous intermediate
    layers and delayed message transmission. We break through traditional communication barriers in the consumer goods industry by delivering
    seamless business collaboration through mobile devices, driving continuous organizational efficiency improvements.</span></td></tr>

