<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Research and development costs for the year ended September 30, 2024
of $1,139,922 decreased by $1,012,680 or 47% compared to $2,152,602 for the year ended September 30, 2023. The decrease was primarily
