    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Consists
    of social security payments required under Chinese law. Although we also reimburse the referenced individuals for reasonable expenses,
    such reimbursements do not, in the aggregate, exceed $10,000 for any individual in any year presented and are not considered perquisites
    because they are integrally and directly related to the performance of such recipients&#8217; jobs.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
