<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Amount
Due From a Related Party</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Amount due from a related party represents reimbursements of business expenses
paid on behalf of the Company. During the year ended September 30, 2025, the Company advanced $17,260 to Shaozhang Lin. The amount is
unsecured, non-interest bearing and repayable on demand. As of September 30, 2025, the balance of amount due from a related party was
$17,486. As of the issuance date of the consolidated financial statements, the repayment amount was nil.</span></p>

