million and $<span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--AccumulatedDeficit_iI_pn5n6_c20240930_zr1zg64ZbiIl" title="Accumulated deficit"><ix:nonFraction name="YAAS:AccumulatedDeficit" contextRef="AsOf2024-09-30" id="Fact000905" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">15.4</ix:nonFraction></span>
million as of September 30, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The Company had net losses of approximately $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--NetIncomeLoss_iN_pn5n6_di_c20241001__20250930_zpicyQzmH7vl" title="Net loss"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" contextRef="From2024-10-01to2025-09-30" id="Fact000907" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" sign="-" unitRef="USD">9.6</ix:nonFraction></span>
million, $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--NetIncomeLoss_iN_pn5n6_di_c20231001__20240930_zNzDvSnB8z9e" title="Net loss"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30" id="Fact000909" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" sign="-" unitRef="USD">1.3</ix:nonFraction></span>
million and $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--NetIncomeLoss_iN_pn5n6_di_c20221001__20230930_zlVcNOlEpIH4" title="Net loss"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30" id="Fact000911" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" sign="-" unitRef="USD">2.3</ix:nonFraction> </span>
million for the years ended September 30, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For the year ended September 30, 2025, Net proceeds from the IPO, September 2025 Public Offering and the exercise of total Series A Warrants
