<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For the year ended September 30, 2025, the Company had <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount_c20241001__20250930__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--PreSplitMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantMember_zQCwFbQ6EVQi" title="Antidilutive securities excluded from computation of earnings per share amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30_custom_PreSplitMember_custom_SeriesAWarrantMember" id="Fact001667" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">36,253,620</ix:nonFraction></span> (post-reverse-split: <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount_c20231001__20240930__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--PostReverseSplitMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesBWarrantMember_zzmtP3OFGp0h" title="Antidilutive securities excluded from computation of earnings per share amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30_custom_PostReverseSplitMember_custom_SeriesBWarrantMember" id="Fact001669" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">453,184</ix:nonFraction></span>) potential shares issuable upon the exercise
