<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
May 2021, the XMKT and GSR each purchased <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--PurchaseOfEquitiesPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20210501__20210531__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--GSRZhaohuaVenturesIIIPartnershipMember_zjWEFP6vb28" title="Purchase of equities percentage"><span id="xdx_902_ecustom--PurchaseOfEquitiesPercentage_pid_dp_uPure_c20210501__20210531__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--XiamenYilianKaitaiArtificialIntelligenceVentureCapitalPartnershipMember_ztsey2uhM3f8" title="Purchase of equities percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="YAAS:PurchaseOfEquitiesPercentage" contextRef="From2021-05-012021-05-31_custom_GSRZhaohuaVenturesIIIPartnershipMember" id="Fact001697" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure"><ix:nonFraction name="YAAS:PurchaseOfEquitiesPercentage" contextRef="From2021-05-012021-05-31_custom_XiamenYilianKaitaiArtificialIntelligenceVentureCapitalPartnershipMember" id="Fact001699" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">1.65</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>% equities from one of the ordinary equity holder, with cash consideration of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--EquityMethodInvestmentSoldCarryingAmount_pn4n6_c20210501__20210531__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--XiamenYilianKaitaiArtificialIntelligenceVentureCapitalPartnershipMember_zvfg1KeON4J5" title="Cash consideration of equity investment"><span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--EquityMethodInvestmentSoldCarryingAmount_pn4n6_c20210501__20210531__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--GSRZhaohuaVenturesIIIPartnershipMember_zwnP6r1J4Xvi" title="Cash consideration of equity investment"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentSoldCarryingAmount" contextRef="From2021-05-012021-05-31_custom_XiamenYilianKaitaiArtificialIntelligenceVentureCapitalPartnershipMember" id="Fact001701" format="ixt:nu