$<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20250930__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--PostReverseSplitMember__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantsMember_zhx9u8BTvUge" title="Warrants exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30_custom_PostReverseSplitMember_custom_SeriesAWarrantsMember" id="Fact001926" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">5.368</ix:nonFraction></span>) per share and the number of share issuable under the Series A Warrant (&#8220;Series A Warrant Shares&#8221;) have be adjusted
